====================================================
MIDDLEWARE PATTERNS
====================================================

- Middleware MUST be in `src/middleware.ts` (root of src/)
- Use `ROUTES` constants for route checks
- Protect routes at edge level (before page loads)
- Redirect authenticated users away from auth pages
- Redirect unauthenticated users from protected pages

Example:
```typescript
import { ROUTES } from '@/constants';

const isAuthRoute = pathname.startsWith(ROUTES.LOGIN) ||
                    pathname.startsWith(ROUTES.SIGNUP);
const isProtectedRoute = pathname.startsWith(ROUTES.DASHBOARD);

if (isProtectedRoute && !token) {
  return NextResponse.redirect(new URL(ROUTES.LOGIN, request.url));
}
```

